A '''Castlewars brew''' is a [[potion]] exclusive to [[Castle Wars]], where they are found on a table in the respawn room. It provides the boosts from a [[super combat potion]], a [[ranging potion]], [[stamina potion]], [[super restore]], and [[imbued heart]] at once.

==Effects==
The potion restores 20% of the player's [[Energy|run energy]] per dose, and offers a 70% reduction in run energy depletion for 2 minutes.

===Melee boost===
Stat boosts to Attack, Strength, and Defence are calculated with: <math>\lfloor SkillLevel \times \frac{15}{100} \rfloor + 5</math>. 

